    {
      "name": "WebSocket Events",
      "description": "Documentation for WebSocket real-time events.\n\nConnect to: ws://{{baseUrl}} with auth token.\n\nThese are not HTTP endpoints - use a WebSocket client.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[WS] Driver Location Update",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/#websocket-driver-location-update",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["#websocket-driver-location-update"]
            },
            "description": "## WebSocket Event: driver:location:update\n\n**Direction:** Client → Server\n\n**Role:** Driver only\n\n**Payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"lat\": 6.5244,\n  \"lng\": 3.3792\n}\n```\n\n**Description:**\nDriver sends their current location. This updates the database and broadcasts to any riders tracking this driver.\n\n**Rate Limit:** 100 requests per minute"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "[WS] Request Nearby Drivers",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/#websocket-nearby-drivers",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["#websocket-nearby-drivers"]
            },
            "description": "## WebSocket Event: rider:request:nearby-drivers\n\n**Direction:** Client → Server\n\n**Role:** Rider only\n\n**Payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"lat\": 6.5244,\n  \"lng\": 3.3792,\n  \"radius\": 5\n}\n```\n\n**Response Event:** rider:nearby-drivers\n```json\n{\n  \"drivers\": [\n    {\n      \"driverId\": \"uuid\",\n      \"lat\": 6.5250,\n      \"lng\": 3.3800,\n      \"distance\": 0.8\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "[WS] Trip Request",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/#websocket-trip-request",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["#websocket-trip-request"]
            },
            "description": "## WebSocket Event: trip:request\n\n**Direction:** Client → Server\n\n**Role:** Rider only\n\n**Payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"driverId\": \"driver-uuid\",\n  \"pickupLat\": 6.5244,\n  \"pickupLng\": 3.3792,\n  \"dropoffLat\": 6.4541,\n  \"dropoffLng\": 3.3947\n}\n```\n\n**Response Events:**\n- To Rider: trip:request:sent `{\"tripId\": \"uuid\"}`\n- To Driver: trip:new-request `{\"tripId\": \"uuid\", \"riderId\": \"uuid\", ...}`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "[WS] Trip Accept",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/#websocket-trip-accept",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["#websocket-trip-accept"]
            },
            "description": "## WebSocket Event: trip:accept\n\n**Direction:** Client → Server\n\n**Role:** Driver only\n\n**Payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"tripId\": \"trip-uuid\"\n}\n```\n\n**Response Events:**\n- To Driver: trip:accept:confirmed `{\"tripId\": \"uuid\"}`\n- To Rider: trip:accepted `{\"tripId\": \"uuid\", \"driverId\": \"uuid\"}`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "[WS] Trip Status Update",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/#websocket-trip-status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["#websocket-trip-status"]
            },
            "description": "## WebSocket Event: trip:status:update\n\n**Direction:** Client → Server\n\n**Role:** Driver or Rider\n\n**Payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"tripId\": \"trip-uuid\",\n  \"status\": \"in_progress\"\n}\n```\n\n**Response Events:**\n- To Both: trip:status `{\"tripId\": \"uuid\", \"status\": \"in_progress\", \"timestamp\": 1234567890}`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "[WS] Track Driver",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/#websocket-track-driver",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["#websocket-track-driver"]
            },
            "description": "## WebSocket Event: rider:track:driver\n\n**Direction:** Client → Server\n\n**Role:** Rider only\n\n**Payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"driverId\": \"driver-uuid\"\n}\n```\n\n**Description:**\nSubscribe to real-time location updates for a specific driver.\n\n**Incoming Events:**\n- driver:location `{\"driverId\": \"uuid\", \"lat\": 6.5244, \"lng\": 3.3792, \"timestamp\": 1234567890}`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "[WS] Stop Tracking Driver",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
