            "description": "## WebSocket Event: rider:untrack:driver\n\n**Direction:** Client → Server\n\n**Role:** Rider only\n\n**Payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"driverId\": \"driver-uuid\"\n}\n```\n\n**Description:**\nUnsubscribe from driver location updates."
          },
          "response": []
        }
